바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">130</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명 파견</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">).</span></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 교원해외파견사업 장기 파견자 선발 공고문을 첨부파일과 같이 안내해 드리니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 많은 지원 바랍니다. </span></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">선발 인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개발도상국 장기파견자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개국 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">61</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 선발 대상 : 파견국별 수요에 맞는 분야의 교원자격증 소지자</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;(현직교원 및 예비교원*), 교육전문가(교수), 퇴직교원(수) 및 퇴직교육행정가</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 예비교원 : 교원자격증 소지자로서 임용시험을 통과하지 못한 경우 및 임용대기중인 사람 포괄</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 전형 방법</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 서류전형(7.3.) : 교과별, 유형별 파견 예정 인원의 3배수 이내 선발</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2차 면접 및 수업 시연(7.8.) : 교과별, 유형별 파견 예정 인원 + 예비 후보</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 지원 방법</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-현직 교원 : (현직교수) 학교에서 우리원으로 전자문서 시행, (현직교사) 시/도 교육청을 통해 일괄 접수(각 시도교육청별 해당 부서),</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 지원자의 이메일 제출 서류(서식1~5)는 해당 시?도 교육청에서 취합 후 국립국제교육원으로 전자문서로 제출[제출 마감 : 2017. 6. 27.(화) 18:00까지]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 지원자는 전체서류 1건 국립국제교육원으로 우편 제출[2017. 6. 27.(화) 18:00 도착해야 함]</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">예비 교원 및 퇴직교직원 자문관 : 국립국제교육원에 개별 접수</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;※ 제출처 : 붙임 선발 공고문 참조</span><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
